# go2rtc release pinned for server installations: v1.9.15.
# The checksums equal the SHA-256 `digest` values GitHub publishes for the release assets and were verified
# against locally downloaded assets (hashed, never executed).
# UP-0 (#1176) may change the version. To bump, run
#   gh release view v<ver> --repo AlexxIT/go2rtc --json assets -q '.assets[]|select(.name|startswith("go2rtc_linux"))|"\(.name) \(.digest)"'
# compare the output with `shasum -a 256` of the downloaded assets, and edit this file only.
